// bubbleWatcher on selectedDocBox (section 7.2)
// Author: not credited on the listing page
// Source: VPRI TR-2012-001 (STEPS 2012 final report), Appendix I (KScript and KSWorld), section 7.2 Bubble selection, lead-in 'it will only respond to halo placement within the document', PDF page 31 (printed page 30)
// Also printed in: VPRI TR-2012-001 (STEPS 2012 final report), Appendix II (Making Applications in KSWorld), section 7.2 Bubble selection, boxed snippet, PDF page 47 (printed page 46)
// Transcribed from the page images; text-layer differences noted below.

bubbleWatcher <-
  when
    mergeE(selectedDocBox,
           textSelection, whole.extent)
  then
    this.checkBubbleVisibility()

// Transcription notes
// - Text layer vs image: no glyph differences found in this listing.
// - Spacing: indentation and alignment come from glyph positions, checked against the page image.
// - Uncertain glyphs: none.
